# FlowPilot currently runs entirely as a frontend demo — no environment
# variables are required to install, run, or build the project.
#
# This file is provided as a placeholder for when a real backend and AI
# provider are connected (see "Future Improvements" in README.md).
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values only when that
# integration work happens. Never commit a real `.env` file.

# Example of what a future backend integration might need:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
# VITE_AI_PROVIDER_API_KEY=
